 "description": "Contract notices and awards from TED (Tenders Electronic Daily), the official EU procurement journal \u2014 buyer, country, CPV codes, values, and deadlines across all member states, normalized for bid intelligence. Blind Mode: only organisation-level fields are ingested. Filters combine with AND; q searches all text fields. Costs 1 credit(s) per call with an API key; without one, a preview of up to 5 rows (20 calls/day).",
